    "body": "This proposal makes sense to me, to allow real subclasses of `TextTrackCue` and not requiring using `VTTCue` and adding extra properties to those objects.\n\nThese cues wouldn't render anything, so a possible followup would be allowing custom cue rendering to avoid overlapping the native controls just like WebVTT does. However, I'm not sure there will be actual developer demand for this.",
